/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   JOY AGENCY — Dark mode
   CRITICAL: All rules must be scoped to .admin-root, .workers-root,
   .detail-root, or .login-root.
   NO @media prefers-color-scheme block. NO :root overrides.
   The public homepage (HomePage, hero, services, etc.) always
